{"language":"en","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","炸裂吧！战车！"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/en","Explode, my chariot!"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","打造一辆玩具车或者控制玩具车致盲敌人。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/en","Damian builds or controls a toy chariot to blind enemies."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，达米安在战斗中不会被攻击，战斗开始时会在布阵位置打造一辆玩具车，继承自身85% + 10%的生命值和100%的其他属性，随后自身退至场外，并会在场上其他友军全部被击败后撤离战场。使用终极技能时，若场上已有玩具车，则驱使玩具车冲向目标位置爆炸，玩具车爆炸时每剩余10%生命值会使达米安恢复80点能量，并对1格范围的敌人造成320% ATK伤害并施加致盲，持续3秒；若场上没有玩具车，则会打造一辆新的玩具车并移动至目标位置。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Passive. Damian cannot be attacked during the battle. He builds a toy chariot that inherits 85% + 10% of his HP and 100% of his other stats to take his place when a battle starts. He then stays out of the battlefield and will run away after all allies are defeated. \nActive. If a toy chariot is present on the battlefield, Damian sends it charging at the target, causing it to explode and deal 320% ATK damage while blinding enemies within 1 tile for 3s. When the toy chariot explodes, Damian recovers 80 Energy for every 10% of its HP ratio. If there is no toy chariot, he builds a new one and moves it to the target location."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":43,"end":49,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":95,"end":101,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":164,"end":172,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":177,"end":179,"tooltip_key":"keyword:blind"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":394,"end":402,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":416,"end":424,"tooltip_key":"keyword:blind"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至330% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 330% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至340% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 340% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至350% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 350% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至360% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 360% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","紧急救援！"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/en","Emergency Support!"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","控制玩具车回复友军生命值或自身回复能量。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/en","Damian controls a toy chariot to recover ally's HP or his own Energy."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","若场上已有玩具车，则控制玩具车为3格范围内最虚弱的一名友军奏乐，使其回复4次-120% − 10% ATK生命值。若场上没有玩具车，则使达米安回复300点能量。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/en","If a toy chariot is present on the battlefield, Damian controls it to play music for the weakest ally within 3 tiles, recovering -120% − 10% ATK HP to this ally 4 times. If there is no toy chariot, Damian recovers himself 300 Energy."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":43,"end":49,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":134,"end":140,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"keyword:weakest"},{"start":38,"end":53,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":89,"end":96,"tooltip_key":"keyword:weakest"},{"start":129,"end":144,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","回复的生命值提升至-130% − 10% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases the healing amount to -130% − 10% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":37,"end":43,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":32,"end":47,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","回复的生命值提升至-140% − 10% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases the healing amount to -140% − 10% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":37,"end":43,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":32,"end":47,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","回复的生命值提升至-150% − 10% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases the healing amount to -150% − 10% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":37,"end":43,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":32,"end":47,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","小飞机来喽！"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/en","It's a Plane!"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","控制玩具飞机眩晕最远的敌人。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/en","Damian controls a toy plane to stun the farthest enemy."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","控制玩具飞机飞向最远的敌人并对其投掷烟花弹，造成250% + 20% ATK伤害，并使目标眩晕3秒。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Damian controls a toy plane to fly towards the farthest enemy and throw fireworks at them, dealing 250% + 20% ATK damage and stunning the target for 3s."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":28,"end":34,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":103,"end":109,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":24,"end":38,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":99,"end":113,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","眩晕时间提升至5秒。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases stun duration to 5s."],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至275% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 275% + 20% ATK."],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至300% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 300% + 20% ATK."],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/en","Hero Focus"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身攻击力。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/en","Increases ATK."],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升12%。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Increases ATK by 12% during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升16%。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases ATK by 16% during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升20%。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases ATK by 20% during battle."],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","发明家意志"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/en","Inventor's Will"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","玩具车提升周围友方英雄急速。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/en","Damian's toy chariots increase the Haste of nearby allied heroes."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","每一辆玩具车在首次响应“紧急救援！”时会展开音乐光环，对周围2格的非召唤物友军进行鼓舞，提升其40点急速，持续10秒。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Damian's toy chariot activates a music halo when it responds to Emergency Support! for the first time, inspiring non-summoned allies within 2 tiles and increasing their Haste by 40 for 10s."],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","期间还会每秒使周围2格的友军回复-80% ATK生命值。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Heals allies within 2 tiles for -80% ATK HP per second."],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":32,"end":40,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","对非召唤物友军进行鼓舞提升其50点急速。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Inspires non-summoned allies and grants them 50 Haste."],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","对非召唤物友军进行鼓舞提升其55点急速。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Inspires non-summoned allies and grants them 55 Haste."],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/en","Enhance Force"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","技能“炸裂吧！战车！”在玩具车剩余生命值较高时，致盲持续时间提升。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/en","The blind duration increases when the toy chariot's HP ratio is high."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","技能“炸裂吧！战车！”在玩具车剩余生命值百分比高于50%时，造成的致盲的持续时间提升至7秒。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/en","When casting Explode, my chariot!, the blind duration is increased to 7s when the toy chariot's HP ratio is above 50%."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":33,"end":35,"tooltip_key":"keyword:blind"}]],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":39,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"keyword:blind"}]],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","释放“紧急救援”时，若场上有玩具车，玩具车治疗友军距离提高到全场，且额外选择一名友军进行治疗；场上无玩具车时，自身额外选择一名最虚弱的友军，使其回复300% ATK生命值。"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/en","If Damian's toy chariot is present when he casts Emergency Support!, the healing range expands to the entire battlefield, and he heals an additional ally. If the toy chariot is not present, Damian instead restores 300% ATK HP to an additional weakest ally."],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":74,"end":82,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":214,"end":222,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","花朵指挥棒"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/en","Wreath Wand"]]}